<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>เข้าสู่ระบบ | ระบบข้อมูลนักศึกษา</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            color-scheme: light;
            --ink: #19324d;
            --muted: #718198;
            --blue: #3979d8;
            --blue-dark: #2864bd;
        }

        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            color: var(--ink);
            background:
                radial-gradient(ellipse at 12% 12%, rgba(190, 224, 255, .7), transparent 34rem),
                radial-gradient(ellipse at 90% 90%, rgba(215, 239, 255, .8), transparent 32rem),
                linear-gradient(135deg, #f8fbff 0%, #eff6ff 52%, #f9fcff 100%);
        }

        .login-card {
            max-width: 440px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .9);
            border-radius: 1.5rem;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .92);
            box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(44, 88, 137, .13);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        }

        .brand-mark {
            display: inline-grid;
            width: 64px;
            height: 64px;
            place-items: center;
            border-radius: 20px;
            color: #fff;
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #69a8f5, #3979d8);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 22px rgba(57, 121, 216, .24);
        }

        .login-subtitle {
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        .form-label {
            color: #344b65;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .form-control {
            min-height: 50px;
            border: 1px solid #dce6f1;
            border-radius: .85rem;
            background-color: #fbfdff;
        }

        .form-control:focus {
            border-color: #82b2f0;
            background-color: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 .22rem rgba(57, 121, 216, .13);
        }

        .btn-login {
            min-height: 50px;
            border: 0;
            border-radius: .85rem;
            color: #fff;
            background: linear-gradient(110deg, #4b8de7, var(--blue-dark));
            box-shadow: 0 9px 18px rgba(57, 121, 216, .2);
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: transform .18s ease, box-shadow .18s ease;
        }

        .btn-login:hover,
        .btn-login:focus-visible {
            color: #fff;
            background: linear-gradient(110deg, #397fdc, #2059ad);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 22px rgba(57, 121, 216, .27);
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        .register-link {
            color: var(--blue-dark);
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .register-link:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        @media (max-width: 575.98px) {
            .login-card {
                border-radius: 1.25rem;
            }
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            *, *::before, *::after {
                transition-duration: .01ms !important;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main class="container min-vh-100 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center py-5">
        <section class="card login-card w-100" aria-labelledby="login-title">
            <div class="card-body p-4 p-sm-5">
                <header class="text-center mb-4">
                    <span class="brand-mark mb-3" aria-hidden="true">
                        <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                            <path d="M12 3 3.5 7.5 12 12l8.5-4.5L12 3Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                            <path d="M7 10v5c2.8 2.4 7.2 2.4 10 0v-5M20.5 8v6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                        </svg>
                    </span>
                    <h1 class="h3 fw-bold mb-2" id="login-title">ยินดีต้อนรับ</h1>
                    <p class="login-subtitle mb-0">เข้าสู่ระบบข้อมูลนักศึกษาของคุณ</p>
                </header>
                <form action="/auth_login" method="post">
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label for="stCode" class="form-label">รหัสนักศึกษา</label>
                        <input type="text" id="stCode" name="stCode" class="form-control"
                               autocomplete="username" required autofocus>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-4">
                        <label for="Password" class="form-label">รหัสผ่าน</label>
                        <input type="password" id="Password" name="Password" class="form-control"
                               autocomplete="current-password" required>
                    </div>
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-login w-100">เข้าสู่ระบบ</button>
                </form>
                <p class="text-center login-subtitle mt-4 mb-0">
                    ยังไม่มีบัญชี? <a class="register-link" href="/register">ลงทะเบียน</a>
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
